  <packaging>jar</packaging>
  <name>GraalVM Native Image Annotation Stubs</name>
  <description>Compile-time stubs for GraalVM Native Image inlining annotations.</description>

  <!-- Compile-only stubs of GraalVM's inlining annotations (unpublishable upstream). They satisfy
       javac without being bundled into consumer jars. Native Image recognizes the annotations by
       name. No runtime dependencies.
       This reactor-only module must not be published or added to an application's runtime. -->
